<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>تم التأكيد — <%= order.groom_name %> و<%= order.bride_name %></title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Aref+Ruqaa:wght@700&family=Tajawal:wght@400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  body{
    background:#fffaf0; color:#2a2115; font-family:'Tajawal', sans-serif;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:100vh; text-align:center; padding:24px;
  }
  h1{ font-family:'Aref Ruqaa', serif; font-size:30px; margin-bottom:14px; color:#8a6423; }
  p{ color:#8a7a5c; margin-bottom:24px; }
  a{ color:#b8892b; text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div>
    <h1>شكراً لتأكيدكم</h1>
    <p>وصل ردكم إلى <%= order.groom_name %> و<%= order.bride_name %> بنجاح.</p>
    <a href="<%= backTo %>">العودة إلى الدعوة</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
